# Paladin — an Intermediate enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 5/12 Intermediate enemies — 18 life, bribe 80 gold
# enemy: Paladin (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0175.dck "Paladin (W, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3 file
#   dated 2016-02-15; its first 15 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 13 lines (60 cards)
#   after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its .vNone/.v<Colour>
#   sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/paladin.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 5) [Tier
#   3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/paladin.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Intermediate) — "Paladin" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Paladin
18 Plains
6 Island
4 Northern Paladin
4 White Knight
2 Benalish Hero
4 Holy Strength
1 Disenchant
2 Red Ward
4 Angry Mob
4 Sleight of Mind
3 Magical Hack
3 Karma
2 Circle of Protection: Black
1 Swords to Plowshares
2 Segovian Leviathan
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   1 Magical Hack, 2 Sleight of Mind
#   .vBlack  1 Swords to Plowshares, 2 Divine Transformation
#   .vBlue   1 Magical Hack, 2 Sleight of Mind
#   .vGreen  1 Magical Hack, 2 Sleight of Mind
#   .vRed    1 Magical Hack, 2 Sleight of Mind
#   .vWhite  1 Magical Hack, 2 Sleight of Mind
SB: 1 Swords to Plowshares
SB: 2 Divine Transformation
